{"answer": "In the MEMMAP address map tables, these acronyms define the result of the bus access:\n\n- **BBBBE**: A bus access is terminated with a **bus error on the BBB**. [S2]/[S3]  \n- **SPBBE**: A bus access is terminated with a **bus error on the SPB**. [S2]/[S3]  \n- **SRIBE**: A bus access is terminated with a **bus error on the SRI**. [S2]/[S3]  \n- **Access**: A bus access is **allowed and is executed**. [S2]/[S3]", "base_url": "https://api.openai.com/v1", "candidate_k": 10, "chunks": "data/chunks.jsonl", "collection": "technical_docs", "dry_run": false, "embedding_model": "BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5", "mode": "bm25", "model": "gpt-5.4-nano", "question": "What do the acronyms BBBBE, SPBBE, SRIBE, and Access mean in the MEMMAP address map tables?", "rrf_k": 60, "sources": [{"bm25_rank": 1, "bm25_score": 16.496698402871285, "chunk_index": 0, "hybrid_rank": null, "id": "S1", "page_end": 90, "page_start": 90, "score": -16.496698402871285, "source": "docs/infineon-aurix-tc3xx-part1-usermanual-en.pdf", "vector_rank": null}, {"bm25_rank": 2, "bm25_score": 16.40841078897078, "chunk_index": 1, "hybrid_rank": null, "id": "S2", "page_end": 90, "page_start": 90, "score": -16.40841078897078, "source": "docs/infineon-aurix-tc3xx-part1-usermanual-en.pdf", "vector_rank": null}, {"bm25_rank": 3, "bm25_score": 16.308613252750867, "chunk_index": 2, "hybrid_rank": null, "id": "S3", "page_end": 90, "page_start": 90, "score": -16.308613252750867, "source": "docs/infineon-aurix-tc3xx-part1-usermanual-en.pdf", "vector_rank": null}, {"bm25_rank": 4, "bm25_score": 15.01214584606531, "chunk_index": 50, "hybrid_rank": null, "id": "S4", "page_end": 102, "page_start": 102, "score": -15.01214584606531, "source": "docs/infineon-aurix-tc3xx-part1-usermanual-en.pdf", "vector_rank": null}, {"bm25_rank": 5, "bm25_score": 11.611097147320338, "chunk_index": 30, "hybrid_rank": null, "id": "S5", "page_end": 97, "page_start": 97, "score": -11.611097147320338, "source": "docs/infineon-aurix-tc3xx-part