{"answer": "Access to the CPU PSPR, DSPR, PCACHE, DCACHE, and the related TAG SRAMs is provided by **memory segments 1 and 3 through 7**. [S1]\n\nMore specifically:  \n- **Segments 1 and 3–7** allow access to **PSPR, DSPR, PCACHE, DCACHE**, and **TAG SRAMs related to Program and Data Cache** (**PTAG SRAM1** and **DTAG SRAM1**). [S2]  \n- **DCACHE / DTAG SRAM1** can be accessed **only if the Data Cache is disabled**. [S2]  \n- **PCACHE / PTAG SRAM1** can be accessed **only if the related Program Cache is disabled**. [S2]", "base_url": "https://api.openai.com/v1", "candidate_k": 10, "chunks": "data/chunks.jsonl", "collection": "technical_docs", "dry_run": false, "embedding_model": "BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5", "mode": "bm25", "model": "gpt-5.4-nano", "question": "Which segments allow access to CPU PSPR, DSPR, PCACHE, DCACHE, and related TAG SRAMs?", "rrf_k": 60, "sources": [{"bm25_rank": 1, "bm25_score": 25.398446060822454, "chunk_index": 0, "hybrid_rank": null, "id": "S1", "page_end": 90, "page_start": 90, "score": -25.398446060822454, "source": "docs/infineon-aurix-tc3xx-part1-usermanual-en.pdf", "vector_rank": null}, {"bm25_rank": 2, "bm25_score": 24.690567962876813, "chunk_index": 1, "hybrid_rank": null, "id": "S2", "page_end": 90, "page_start": 90, "score": -24.690567962876813, "source": "docs/infineon-aurix-tc3xx-part1-usermanual-en.pdf", "vector_rank": null}, {"bm25_rank": 3, "bm25_score": 14.287955311505279, "chunk_index": 30, "hybrid_rank": null, "id": "S3", "page_end": 97, "page_start": 97, "score": -14.287955311505279, "source": "docs/infineon-aurix-tc3xx-part1-usermanual-en.pdf", "vector_rank": null}, {"bm25_rank": 4, "bm25_score": 10.89084339496211, "chunk_index": 31, "hybrid_rank": null, "id": "S4", "page_end": 97, "page_start": 97, "score": -10.89084339496211, "source": "docs/infineon-aurix-tc3xx-part1-usermanual-en.pdf", "vector_rank": null}, {"bm25_rank": 5, "bm25_score": 9.208694600048647, "chunk_index": 3, "hybrid_rank": null, "id": "S5", "page_end": 91